gametitle=Grand Theft Auto III (USA) - SLUS-20062 / 5E115FB6
// Map Toggle 1.0 release candidate. Cold boot required. See README.md.
// Uses original radar tiles and HUD sprites; no ISO modification.
// Public credit: Zeroable.

[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Map Toggle\Enable - Press Start and Select/Cross to Toggle Icons]
description=Start + Select opens/closes the map. Cross hides/shows location icons.
// Reserve 16 KiB before game heap allocation and initialize runtime state.
